  "details": "For the past couple of months now ever since I updated my game on quest, I've been disconnecting randomly out of nowhere, At first I thought it was an internet problem. So I tried fixing my internet and even swapping it. The time but still no change. And I tested out other games on my headset to see if it was just VR chat and turns out it was every other game runs smoothly. I use a quest three and This issue really bugs me cuz it happens Almost every little moment. I can barely hang out with friends because of it. I'm just hoping y'all can fix this. Because I would be lying if I said I wasn't getting on my nerves.",
